flowchart TD
  Req[HTTP Request] --> Forwarded[Trusted Forwarded Headers]
  Forwarded --> Errors[Exception Handling / ProblemDetails]
  Errors --> Https[HTTPS / HSTS]
  Https --> Route[Routing + endpoint metadata]
  Route --> Slug[Canonical Store Slug Resolution]
  Slug --> Csrf[CSRF for unsafe browser methods]
  Csrf --> Scope[Identity and Store Scope Binding]
  Scope --> AuthN[Authentication]
  AuthN --> AuthZ[Authorization / Membership / Resource Policy]
  AuthZ --> UC[Application Use Case]
  UC --> DB[(Persistence)]
